# A line: the slide table's backside approach into a BS Noseslide (I + up as it locks on), popped out
# with a pop shove-it (J + down).
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -8.5 1.4 0.14 25
hold up 6..80
hold ollie 70..90
hold up 124..131
tap grind 128
hold ollie 165..182
tap flip+down 186
bot balance
run 360
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Noseslide,slide=true} within 125..135
expect event trickEnd{trick=Pop Shove-It} within 200..240
expect no event bail
